[[File:Oozeback Bloom monster screenshot.jpg|thumb|right|280px|Oozeback Bloom and its Degeneration Aura effect]]
'''Degeneration Aura''' is a [[monster aura]] that deals [[chaos]] [[damage over time]] to nearby enemies. It can be found on monsters with the mod {{c|normal|Enemies take Chaos Damage over time}} that displayed under their nameplate, or monster that use the skill id [[Skill:ChaosDegenAura|ChaosDegenAura]] (it will not display in the nameplate). Monster with any one variant, will have a visual aura-effect under it.

The Degeneration aura also has physical damage and lightning damage variants, but they are more rarely found.
==Sources==
===Chaos===
There are two variants of Chaos Degeneration Aura:

* Any unique monster with the modifier [[Modifier:MonsterAuraEnemyLifeDegen1|MonsterAuraEnemyLifeDegen1]] (#% of player's Maximum Life taken as Chaos DOT):
** [[Oozeback Bloom]] and its map variants: [[Drought-Maddened Rhoa]], [[Skullbeak]] (6%)
** [[Plague Retch]] (4%)
** [[Rancor]] (4%)
** [[Abaxoth, the End of All That Is]] (4%, no longer encounterable in-game)

* Any monster that use the skill [[Skill:ChaosDegenAura|ChaosDegenAura]] (deals a fixed base Chaos DOT), for example:
** [[Shaggy Monstrosity]] (can be a [[Raise Spectre|raised spectre]]) 
** [[Kalria, The Risen]] (a [[Warband]] member and the second form of [[Kalria, The Fallen]])
** [[Unthinking]] (no longer encounterable in-game)

See also: {{sl|Death Aura}}

===Physical===
[[Tormented Spirit|Tormented Charlatan]]  (#% of player's Maximum Life taken as Physical DOT)

See also: {{stl|Remnant of Corruption}}

===Lightning===
The laser beam found in [[The Eradicator]]'s arenas applies a debuff known as "Degeneration Aura" (deals a fixed base Lightning DOT).

See also: {{stl|Scientist's Beam}}, {{stl|Piety Beam}}, {{stl|Lightning Beam}}

==See also==
There are other monster auras that also deal damage over time:
* [[Modifier:MonsterAuraEnemyLifeDegenCold]] - from [[Locust Swarm]], a monster possessed by Talisman. (Cold damage over time)
* [[Modifier:MonsterAuraEnemyLifeDegenFire]] - from [[Locust Swarm]], a monster possessed by Talisman (Fire damage over time)
* [[Modifier:MonsterAuraEnemyLifeDegenLightning]]  - from [[Locust Swarm]], a monster possessed by Talisman. (Lightning damage over time)
* [[Modifier:MonsterAuraEssenceEnemyLifeDegen1]] - from monster possessed by Essence (Chaos damage over time)

